      "message": "To reduce duplication, you could extract the common properties into a base macro, and then define the `RAW` and `REAL` image properties on top of it. This would also make the difference between the two more explicit.\n\nFor example:\n\n```c\n#define FPC1025_BASE_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\twidth \u003d \u003c160\u003e; \\\n\theight \u003d \u003c160\u003e; \\\n\tbits-per-pixel \u003d \u003c8\u003e; \\\n\tv4l2-pixel-format \u003d \"V4L2_PIX_FMT_GREY\";\n\n#define FPC1025_RAW_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\tFPC1025_BASE_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\t/*\n\t * Sensor raw image size\n\t *\n\t * Value from fpc_bep_image_get_buffer_size(): (160*160)+660\n\t */ \\\n\tframe-size \u003d \u003c26260\u003e;\n\n#define FPC1025_REAL_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\tFPC1025_BASE_IMAGE_PROPS \\\n\t/* Sensor real image size: (160*160) */ \\\n\tframe-size \u003d \u003c25600\u003e;\n```\n\nThis same suggestion applies to `helipilot.dts` as well.",
